          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A hatchback vehicle was purchased for $16 980 three years ago.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "By using declining-balance depreciation, the current value of the vehicle is $9614.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What is the annual percentage rate of depreciation, correct to two decimal places?",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$17.27\\%$ p.a.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}S&=V_0(1-r)^n\\\\9614&=16980(1-r)^3\\\\(1-r)^3&=\\frac{9614}{16980}\\\\r&=1-\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{9614}{16980}}\\end{align*}$$\nThe annual depreciation rate is $100\\left(1-\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{9614}{16980}}\\right)\\%=17.27\\%$ p.a., correct to two decimal places.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 44
  },
